<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE -- July M3 data due shortly.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE -- July M3 data due shortly.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Tuesday it would release German M3 money supply data for July shortly.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
